   "source": [
    "# DATA ANALYSIS SAMPLE PROJECT 1."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a309b19b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Car Price Dataset example"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7579cfd0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Dataset description\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Why dataset description?\n",
    "Dataset description is neccesary for understanding the datset before analysis as analyst you do not have too rush into data analysis without first understanding you scope and other more metadata on variables you are going to carry out analysis from.\n",
    "\n",
    "This essential for data analysis to go smoothly after understandng the purpose structure and more basic information required on dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "`This dataset contains information about used cars listed on different websites`\n",
    "This data can be used for a lot of purposes such as price prediction to exemplify the use of linear regression in Machine Learning and others.\n",
    "The columns in the given dataset is as follows:\n",
    "- Car_Name\n",
    "- Year\n",
    "- Selling_Price\n",
    "- Present_Price\n",
    "- Kms_Driven\n",
    "- Fuel_Type\n",
    "- Seller_Type\n",
    "- Transmission\n",
    "- Owner"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9f502b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Installing Libraries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "37d134f5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
